# NeverSettle Kernel v3.2
# Linux/arm64 4.19.325 Kernel Configuration
#

#
# Compiler: Android (13065274, +pgo, +bolt, +lto, +mlgo, based on r547379) clang version 20.0.0 (https://android.googlesource.com/toolchain/llvm-project f142f8afe21bceb00fb495468aa0b5043e98c419)
